  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rc7MUQx.png\" width=\"4585\" height=\"334\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這張Minecraft地圖將帶你踏上一場以終極幸運方塊2模組為核心的刺激挑戰之旅，</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">包含超過20種幸運方塊。</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">你將出現在虛空中的一個浮動方塊上，必須不斷打破幸運方塊才能生存。祝你好運！</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">但還不止於此。每打破3個方塊，幸運方塊的種類就會改變，帶來全新的驚喜與挑戰！</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">準備好在這個獨特而有限的世界中，體驗充滿刺激、危險與機會的冒險吧。樂趣永不停止！</h3><hr><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DGCQnGt.gif\" width=\"917\" height=\"514\"></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iCl4tBz.png\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iCl4tBz.png\"><br></span></h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>我的Discord：</em></strong><a h